# The PNZ Postman artefacts (collection + env files, including one
# with an RSA dev PEM) are a contract guard rail for the C# client in
# the upstream `lime-payments` repo. They aren't needed by the public
# SDKs/CLI in this repo -- those talk to LinoPay's own API surface,
# mocked separately under wiremock/linopay/. Carrying them forward
# here would mean publishing a fixture PEM on a public repo.
test-infra/wiremock/pnz/postman/
